WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.628 --> 00:00:05.667
Velstrian Bid. From notice to approved
answer.

2
00:00:06.282 --> 00:00:11.596
Discover lists live UK tenders, and each
one names the register it came from.

3
00:00:11.596 --> 00:00:17.600
Relevance compares each one with the
sectors and regions of your recent bids.

4
00:00:18.241 --> 00:00:22.254
Bid or no bid shows fit in parts, each
with its reason.

5
00:00:22.254 --> 00:00:27.733
Fit is context. It is not a probability of
award.

6
00:00:28.374 --> 00:00:32.528
Draft my response drafts the questions it
can from your profile,

7
00:00:32.528 --> 00:00:36.400
your answer library and your past bids.

8
00:00:37.015 --> 00:00:40.663
Every drafted answer is labelled AI
drafted.

9
00:00:40.663 --> 00:00:45.933
Read it, check the figures against the
tender, and edit it.

10
00:00:46.548 --> 00:00:49.064
A person approves every answer.

11
00:00:49.064 --> 00:00:53.033
Velstrian Bid never submits for you.

12
00:00:53.674 --> 00:00:58.167
Velstrian Bid, from Velstrian Tenderworks.

